{"version":1,"id":"sam-hunt-break-up-in-a-small-town","title":"Break Up In a Small Town","artist":"Sam Hunt","key":"G","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/sam-hunt/break-up-in-a-small-town/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Sam Hunt, Shane L. McAnally and Zach Crowell","chords":[{"symbol":"Fm","canonical":"Fm","keyboardPitchClasses":[5,8,0],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"G#","canonical":"G#","keyboardPitchClasses":[8,0,3],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D#","canonical":"D#","keyboardPitchClasses":[3,7,10],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C#","canonical":"C#","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,5,8],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"instrumental","text":"Intro:","columns":9,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":7,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":" I knew I'd see her around","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":" I'd be at some party, she'd show up and I'd be walking out","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":49,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":" Across some parking lot, hiding behind her sister","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":27,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":" I'd look up, she'd be at the red light beside me","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":30,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":" In that white max with the sticker on the back","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":" I'd act like I didn't see her","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":29,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":" And we'd pay at the same pumps","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":" Flip through the same stations","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":" And slow down for the same curves","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":" Run around with the same crowds","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":23,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":" We just needed some time","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":" She could get on with her life and I'd get on with mine","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":" Thought I would be fine, but maybe not","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":22,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":" I knew she'd find a way to get over me","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":" But I'd never thought that","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"section","text":"[CHORUS]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":" She would get down with somebody I know","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":" I guess that's just how it goes","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":30,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":" When you break up in a small town","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":26,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":" I see our friends and they put on a show","columns":42,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":13,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C#","column":40,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":" Like they don't want me to know","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":29,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":" So they give me the go-around","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":22,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":" But there's only so many streets and so many lights","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":18,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":" I swear it's like I can't even leave my house","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":20,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#","column":34,"beat":1},{"symbol":"D#","column":40,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Fm","column":46,"beat":3}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":" I should have known all along","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":27,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":" You gotta move and move on","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":25,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":" When you break up in a small town","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":" For a while I guess they were keeping it low-key","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":" And now it's like these county lines closing in on me","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":52,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":" I see em everywhere together","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":" And it's getting a little too close to home","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":" She's so far gone, but she didn't go far","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":" She was over me before the grass grew back where she used to park her car","columns":74,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":" She's leaving those same marks in someone else's yard","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":22,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":" In someone else's arms right down the road","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":" And I never thought","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"section","text":"[CHORUS]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"lyric","text":" She would get down with somebody I know","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-40","kind":"lyric","text":" I guess that's just how it goes","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":30,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-41","kind":"lyric","text":" When you break up in a small town","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":26,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-42","kind":"lyric","text":" I see our friends and they put on a show","columns":42,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":13,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C#","column":40,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-43","kind":"lyric","text":" Like they don't want me to know","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":29,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-44","kind":"lyric","text":" So they give me the go-around","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":22,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-45","kind":"lyric","text":" But there's only so many streets and so many lights","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":18,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-46","kind":"lyric","text":" I swear it's like I can't even leave my house","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":20,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#","column":34,"beat":1},{"symbol":"D#","column":40,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Fm","column":46,"beat":3}]},{"id":"line-47","kind":"lyric","text":" I should have known all along","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":27,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-48","kind":"lyric","text":" You gotta move and move on","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":25,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-49","kind":"lyric","text":" When you break up in a small town","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-50","kind":"instrumental","text":"(2x)","columns":19,"beats":10,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#","column":3,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D#","column":6,"beat":4},{"symbol":"G#","column":9,"beat":6},{"symbol":"D#","column":12,"beat":8}]},{"id":"line-51","kind":"lyric","text":" Her mailbox is seven minutes from mine","columns":39,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-52","kind":"lyric","text":" And I drive in the town sometimes and I see her there sittin there with him","columns":78,"beats":5,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":29,"beat":1},{"symbol":"G#","column":76,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-53","kind":"lyric","text":" I want to jump out I want to fight I want to say .... that guy","columns":63,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":30,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C#","column":61,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-54","kind":"lyric","text":" But I can't cause it's my fault and I let her go","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":28,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-55","kind":"lyric","text":" I never thought","columns":17,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":15,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-56","kind":"section","text":"[CHORUS]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-57","kind":"lyric","text":" She would get down with somebody I know","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-58","kind":"lyric","text":" I guess that's just how it goes","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":30,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-59","kind":"lyric","text":" When you break up in a small town","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#","column":26,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-60","kind":"lyr